 an unrelated desktop executable.\n- No `preinstall`, `install`, `postinstall`, or `prepare` lifecyc"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"le scripts run during package installation."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Windows 10 or Windows 11.\n- DeepSeek Harness with the `web` profile.\n- Microsoft Edge or Google Ch"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"rome.\n- Node.js 22.19 or newer, as required by DSH."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Install the bundle into the Web profile:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` once. Plugin activation writes the portable launcher configuration under `~/.dsh/w"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"hale-desktop-launcher/` and creates:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Double-click the desktop application for later launches."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Optional whale-maid skin"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The launcher works with the related non-commercial `Small-tailqwq/dsh-deep-whale` skin:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"That skin has its own CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license and attribution requirements."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Remove the DSH bundle:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The plugin deliberately does not delete user-facing files on unload. Remove these manually if desire"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"e plugin deliberately does not delete user-facing files on unload. Remove these manually if desired:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The prebuilt executable is committed under `assets/`, so installing from GitHub does not require bui"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"able is committed under `assets/`, so installing from GitHub does not require build-script approval."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Licenses"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- Source code: MIT.\n- Whale-girl artwork: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, non-commercial use only."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"This is a community project and is not an official DeepSeek AI product."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
